    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "titus",
      "text": "Three weeks of rain. My armour has rusted in places I did not know it had."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "titus",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "point"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "This rise will do. High ground, and the river at our back. Pitch the camp."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "sound",
      "sound": "hammer"
    },
    {
      "type": "prop",
      "prop": "tent",
      "x": -4
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "duration": 0.4
    },
    {
      "type": "sound",
      "sound": "hammer"
    },
    {
      "type": "prop",
      "prop": "banner",
      "x": 2.5
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "duration": 0.4
    },
    {
      "type": "sound",
      "sound": "ignite"
    },
    {
      "type": "prop",
      "prop": "campfire",
      "x": -1.5
    },
    {
      "type": "sound",
      "sound": "fireCrackle"
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "duration": 0.8
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "bashir",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "bashir",
      "text": "The Shahbanu's last words sit badly with me, General. The Crown knows where our camp lies."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "bashir",
      "text": "The wagons, the wounded, the cooks and smiths who follow us. All of them sleep here."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "bashir",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "Then we double the watch and keep the fires low. We did not come this far to be caught sleeping."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "point"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "roxana",
      "text": "Look at the valley. Every castle down there sits in its own lake. Moats, and deep ones."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "roxana",
      "text": "Water drowns my fire and swallows your stones. These lords learned from someone."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "spawn",
      "actor": "messenger",
      "character": "messenger",
      "x": 12,
      "facing": -1,
      "pose": "walk"
    },
    {
      "type": "camera",
      "x": 4,
      "y": -1.6,
      "viewHeight": 7.5,
      "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
      "type": "move",
      "actor": "messenger",
      "x": 4.5,
      "duration": 2.5
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "messenger",
      "pose": "kneel"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "messenger",
      "text": "My lords, forgive me. I am only a miller from the low fields. You are the ones who break castles?"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "talk",
      "facing": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "We are. Speak freely."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "messenger",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "messenger",
      "text": "The Black Baron rules this land. Every one of his castles is ringed with water, and his Black Keep with the deepest moat of all."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "messenger",
      "text": "His riders take our grain and burn what they cannot carry. No army has ever crossed his water."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "messenger",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "Then we will be the first. Go home, friend, and bar your door."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "messenger",
      "pose": "walk",
      "facing": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "move",
      "actor": "messenger",
      "x": 13,
      "duration": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "remove",
      "actor": "messenger"
    },
    {
      "type": "camera",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -1.6,
      "viewHeight": 7,
      "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "titus",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "titus",
      "text": "Moats. In the arena we would have called it an unfair fight."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "titus",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "At first light we take the nearest house. The Moat House. Let the Baron hear us coming."
    },
